OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a 
OL,6,Fdry night with lengthy clear spells.   
OL,7,FCloudier and breezier over western     
OL,8,FArgyll, while elsewhere it will be     
OL,9,Fcold with frost forming.               
OL,11,CThursday:FDry and mostly cloudy in the 
OL,12,Fmorning and afternoon with some bright 
OL,13,Fintervals. Rain and hill snow, heavy   
OL,14,Fat times, spreading east in the        
OL,15,Fevening. Winds strengthening with      
OL,16,Fcoastal gales.                         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
