OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStrong   
OL,6,Fwinds, rain and hills snow early       
OL,7,FFriday clearing to bright spells and   
OL,8,Fshowers. Mostly dry and cloudy on      
OL,9,FSaturday, then rain overnight. Heavy   
OL,10,Fshowers spreading east Sunday.         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
